  <!-- HOLLOW GOLEM -->
  <!--原中文: '由魔法精华和奥术催化剂制成的傀儡。空洞傀儡周围的盔甲将魔法核心固定在物理位置，以保护其身体的完整性。空洞傀儡能够利用巨量的魔法能量用于各种用途，使其成为迄今为止最灵活的傀儡之一。空洞傀儡从大气中吸收魔法能量，很像潘希斑，一个傀儡造成的地域法力回复速度减少量相当于10个潘希斑。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'A golem crafted from condensed magic and arcane catalysts. The armor surrounding the hollow golem anchors the magic center to a physical location and to protect its physical integrity. The hollow golem is able to harness tremendous amounts of magical energy for a variety of purposes, making it one of the most flexible golems developed to date. The hollow golem absorbs magical energy from the atmosphere, much like paracyte, with mana reduction equivalent to 10 paracyte thorn bushes.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: A golem crafted from condensed magic and arcane catalysts. The armor surrounding the hollow golem anchors the magic center to a physical location and to protect its physical integrity. The hollow golem is able to harness tremendous amounts of magical energy for a variety of purposes, making it one of the most flexible golems developed to date. The hollow golem absorbs magical energy from the atmosphere, much like paracyte, with mana reduction equivalent to 10 paracyte thorn bushes.-->
